{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23363","headline":"劝酒 · 白居易","name":"劝酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劝君一醆君莫辞，劝君两醆君莫疑，劝君三醆君始知。\n面上今日老昨日，心中醉时胜醒时。\n天地迢遥自长久，白兔赤乌相趂走。\n身後堆金拄北斗，不如生前一樽酒。\n君不见春明门外天欲明，喧喧歌哭半死生。\n游人驻马出不得，白轝素车争路行。\n归去来，头已白，典钱将用买酒吃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}